{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e2270d49-4683-8edd-89b3-d26e8bb8ea2f",
  "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:02:18-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Esteban Ortiz",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:56:15-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:56:21-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello. Esteban Ortiz calling. I know it's Saturday and City Hall's closed, so I'm calling the storm line like the recording said. Hope that's the right number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:56:34-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's the right one. We pick up here on the weekends when there's weather. What's going on, Mr. Ortiz?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:56:43-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I got water coming into the yard from the storm. This nor'easter that came in Friday and wrapped up today. It runs down the hill from the next street over and goes straight into my yard, right along the side of the house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:57:03-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Water coming off the hill from the next street and into your yard. Can I get the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:57:12-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "264 Rhode Island Avenue. Historic Hill. If you're coming from the water side, it's up past where the bank used to be, you turn there and go up. I own the building, I'm the landlord, I don't live in the front unit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:57:32-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "264 Rhode Island Avenue, got it. And you're the owner. Is the water getting into the building, or is it staying in the yard?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:57:44-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the yard right now. It's pooled up against the back steps, but it hasn't gone in the door. I looked a little while ago."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:57:56-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. And you said it's coming down from the next street. Do you know where it's entering, like a drain that's not taking it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:58:08-05:00",
      "duration": 26,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, there's a drain up at the corner, and it's got a lot of leaves on it. And there's a manhole cover in the road there that looks off by an inch or so. Sits a little high on one side. I don't know if that's got anything to do with it, but I noticed it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:58:34-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a manhole cover that looks off by about an inch. Is it on your street or the street above?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:58:44-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The street above. Right where the water starts coming down. Not in front of my house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:58:52-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. I'll note that, the cover sitting uneven on the upper street, and the drain with leaves on it at the corner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:59:03-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Now, can I ask you something? Is that a city drain or a state one? Because that's a wide road up there, and I never know who takes care of what."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:59:18-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. Most of the drains on the neighborhood streets are the city's. Some of the bigger roads belong to the state. I'd have to have the crew look at that exact corner to say for sure. If it's the state's, we pass it along to them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:59:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So you'll figure it out and send it to whoever."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:59:45-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. I'll put in the report either way, so you don't have to chase down the right office."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:59:54-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. That's good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:59:56-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is the water running across the road itself, or is it mostly coming down a driveway or the sidewalk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T12:00:05-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mostly the road, then it cuts across the corner and down my side yard. There's a slope, you know. It's been like that a while but today it's heavier."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T12:00:19-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Heavier today because of the storm. Is anyone in danger, or is there a car stuck, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T12:00:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, nothing like that. Just the water in the yard."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T12:00:34-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Let me read this back. 264 Rhode Island Avenue, runoff coming down from the street above into the yard, uneven manhole cover about an inch off on the upper street, and a leaf-clogged drain at the corner. You want to know if it's city or state. Did I get it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T12:00:57-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. That's all of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T12:01:01-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And a good number to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T12:01:05-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0194. That's the landline. Fair warning, I've got the wifi for the tenants and it drops every time the microwave runs, so if you try the other line, forget it. Use the house phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T12:01:21-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 401-555-0194, the landline. I'll make a note to use that one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T12:01:27-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T12:01:28-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I should tell you, the crews are busy right now with the storm, so it may not be today. If the water starts going into the building, call us back right away and say so, and it'll get bumped up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T12:01:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. I'll keep an eye on the back door."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T12:01:52-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If you can, keep anything off the floor near that door in the meantime."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T12:01:59-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I already moved the tenant's boxes up on the shelf. Okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T12:02:05-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T12:02:10-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's all. Thank you, Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T12:02:14-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Ortiz. Take care."
    }
  ],
